uto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a>:</b> <b>Leather</b> armor is made of the hide of animals. It provides decent protection without excessively restricting the user's movements.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF; width: 150px;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; width: 450px;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008005000</span>8,005<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels\" title=\"The Night Revels\">The Night Revels</a></b>, Turn in <a href=\"/page/Item:Cloak_of_Night_(level_16)\" title=\"Item:Cloak of Night (level 16)\">Cloak of Night (level 16)</a><br /><div style=\"display: inline-block; width: 24px;\">&#160;</div>and <b>150</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Piece_of_Darkest_Chocolate\" title=\"Item:Piece of Darkest Chocolate\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_PieceOfDarkestChocolate.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Piece_of_Darkest_Chocolate\" title=\"Item:Piece of Darkest Chocolate\">Piece of Darkest Chocolate</a></b>, obtained in the <a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels_-_Delera%27s_Graveyard\" title=\"The Night Revels - Delera&#39;s Graveyard\">Crypt</a>, in <a href=\"/page/Category:Challenges_in_Night_Revels_Crypt\" title=\"Category:Challenges in Night Revels Crypt\">any challenge</a>, and via <a href=\"/page/Item:Draught_of_Midnight\" title=\"Item:Draught of Midnight\">Draught of Midnight</a></span></span><b>40</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Pinch_of_Sinister_Cinnamon\" title=\"Item:Pinch of Sinister Cinnamon\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_PinchOfSinisterCinnamon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Pinch_of_Sinister_Cinnamon\" title=\"Item:Pinch of Sinister Cinnamon\">Pinch of Sinister Cinnamon</a></b>, obtained in <a href=\"/page/Hayweird_Foundry\" title=\"Hayweird Foundry\">Hayweird Foundry</a>, <a href=\"/page/The_Snitch_and_the_Lich\" title=\"The Snitch and the Lich\">The Snitch and the Lich</a></span></span><b>80</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Shadowy_Caramel\" title=\"Item:Shadowy Caramel\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_ShadowyCaramel.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Shadowy_Caramel\" title=\"Item:Shadowy Caramel\">Shadowy Caramel</a></b>, obtained in <a href=\"/page/Getting_Ahead_in_Lordsmarch_Palace\" title=\"Getting Ahead in Lordsmarch Palace\">Getting Ahead in Lordsmarch Palace</a></span></span> at <a href=\"/page/Joe_Candymaker\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Joe Candymaker\">Joe Candymaker</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Invisibility_Guard\" title=\"Invisibility Guard\">Invisibility&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Invisibility_Guard\" title=\"Invisibility Guard\">Invisibility&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item has a chance of granting you temporary invisibility when you are hit by foes. The invisibility will not be removed when you attack or take damage, but it will wear off after 10 seconds.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Ghostly\" title=\"Ghostly\"> Ghostly</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Ghostly\" title=\"Ghostly\"> Ghostly</a>:</b> Equipping this item causes you to become partially incorporeal. Your melee attacks do not roll a miss chance for Incorporeal targets. Enemy attacks have a 10% chance to miss you due to <a href=\"/page/Incorporeal\" title=\"Incorporeal\">incorporeality</a>. You receive a +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to your <a href=\"/page/Hide\" title=\"Hide\">Hide</a> and <a href=\"/page/Move_Silently\" title=\"Move Silently\">Move Silently</a> skills.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Deathblock\" title=\"Deathblock\">Deathblock</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Deathblock\" title=\"Deathblock\">Deathblock</a>:</b> The wearer of this item is immune to all death spells and magical death effects.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nightmare_Guard\" title=\"Nightmare Guard\">Nightmare&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nightmare_Guard\" title=\"Nightmare Guard\">Nightmare&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item has a chance to terrorizing foes that hit you, applying a Mind Thrust effect, when you are hit by them (dealing 5d8 force damage, Will save vs. Enchantments negates). It may also expose your foes to their greatest fears, acting as a Phantasmal Killer spell.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dodge_bonus\" title=\"Dodge bonus\"> Dodge +4%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dodge_bonus\" title=\"Dodge bonus\"> Dodge +4%</a>:</b> +4% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Dodge.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">DR</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 5/Good</b>: Reduces  physical damage by 5, except from Good attacks.</span></span> 5/Good</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cloak_of_Night_(level_20).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cloak_of_Night_%28level_20%29.png/420px-Cloak_of_Night_%28level_20%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"523\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Cloak_of_Night_%28level_20%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Joe_Candymaker\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Joe Candymaker\">Joe Candymaker</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Cloak_of_Night_(level_24)\" title=\"Item:Cloak of Night (level 24)\">Cloak of Night (level 24)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This Cloak is as smooth and dark as the most pitch-black of nights. Wearing it makes you difficult to spot and attack, and by awakening its powers you will enable it to aid you against creatures native to the darkness.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817035712\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.102 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.149 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4327/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 39500/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15846/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n110.89%  140.083     61 Template:IO\n100.00%  126.328      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  126.328      1 -total\n 96.28%  121.623      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 37.18%   46.968      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 36.34%   45.901      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 35.05%   44.273      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 34.07%   43.042     11 Template:Popup\n 33.78%   42.677      2 Template:InCategory\n 16.16%   20.409      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:12389-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817035712 and revision id 663131. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
